# CV Workspace

This is a **meta-repo**. Project code lives in Git submodules under **`repos/<category>/`**, not at the workspace root. Categories: `docs`, `templates`, `productive-apps`, `utils`, `personal-projects`.

## Submodules

- **repos/personal-projects/resume-data-source** — JSON resume data (`index.json`) and image assets. Deployed separately to GitHub Pages.
- **repos/personal-projects/portfolio** — React + Vite portfolio site. Consumes resume data from the published data source.
- **repos/utils/cv-generator** — Markdown CV templates (`cv-md/`) and converter tooling (`converter/`).

Showcase projects (linked from `repos/personal-projects/resume-data-source/index.json` `projects[]`):

- **repos/personal-projects/rn-speed-art** — React Native design library
- **repos/templates/React-Next-Dashboard** — Next.js dashboard template (BoxBook, Lab Maintenance, Stack Questions)
- **repos/templates/react-node-template** — React + Node.js REST API monorepo template
- **repos/personal-projects/Mettaton-compiler** — Robotics programming language and compiler
- **repos/personal-projects/Smart-house** — IoT smart home platform
- **repos/personal-projects/mintel** — Smart House landing page

productive-apps (`personal-api` and module clients):

- **repos/productive-apps/personal-api** — Shared platform REST API
- **repos/productive-apps/user-management-app** — User management SPA
- **repos/productive-apps/fitness-nutrition-tracker** — Fitness / nutrition SPA
- **repos/productive-apps/finance-app** — Finance SPA
- **repos/productive-apps/full-groceries-app** — Groceries SPA
- **repos/productive-apps/kanban-dashboard** — Kanban SPA
- **repos/productive-apps/kanban-cli** — Kanban CLI

Other projects live under `repos/personal-projects/` (for example `car-history-app`, `groceries-app`, `screen-recorder`, `arqueologIA-api`, `NexaRize-Components`). Reference notes: `repos/docs/js-arrays-methods`. CLIs: `repos/utils/` (`pdf-to-png`, `heic-to-png`, `slides-generator`, `job-scraper-cli`, `cv-generator`).

## Workflow

- Run `./scripts/update-submodules.sh` after pulling parent repo changes to sync submodules to their tracked branches. Pass a category name (`docs`, `templates`, `productive-apps`, `utils`, `personal-projects`) to limit the update.
- When submodules are updated, commit the pointer changes in the parent repo (`./scripts/update-submodules.sh --commit`).
- Make code changes inside the relevant submodule directory under `repos/<category>/`, then commit and push from that submodule's repo.
- Shared Cursor rules and scripts belong in the parent workspace root (`.agents/`, `scripts/`).

## Data flow

```
repos/personal-projects/resume-data-source (index.json) → repos/personal-projects/portfolio (fetches published JSON)
repos/personal-projects/resume-data-source (index.json projects[].repo) → showcase project submodules
repos/personal-projects/resume-data-source (cv-md)      → repos/utils/cv-generator (converter scripts)
```
